{"unit_id":"tag:02KS:statement","translation":"性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>是普遍闭（universally closed）的”在基底（base）上是 fpqc 局部（local）的。\n","allowed_english":["fpqc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭","context":"态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底","context":"局部性所在基底；待决。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"fpqc 局部性；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02KS:proof","translation":"根据定义，普遍闭（universally closed）态射（morphism）的基变换（base change）是普遍闭（universally closed）的。普遍闭（universally closed）这一性质在基底（base）上是 Zariski 局部（local）的（由定义可得，或见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>）。最后，设<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affine schemes）之间的平坦（flat）满射（surjective）态射（morphism），并设<MATH_0002>是一个态射（morphism）。假设基变换（base change）<MATH_0003>是普遍闭（universally closed）的。设<MATH_0004>是任意态射（morphism）。考虑图（diagram）<MATH_0005>，其中两个方块都是笛卡尔（cartesian）的。因此，假设意味着中间的竖直箭头是闭（closed）的。右侧的水平（horizontal）箭头是平坦（flat）的、拟紧（quasi-compact）的且满射（surjective）的（因为它们是<MATH_0006>的基变换（base changes））。所以，<MATH_0007>的子集（subset）是闭（closed）的，当且仅当它在<MATH_0008>中的逆（inverse）像（image）是闭（closed）的，见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>。一个简单的图（diagram）追踪说明右侧的竖直箭头也是闭（closed）的，于是得到<MATH_0009>是普遍闭（universally closed）的。所以引理<REF_0003>适用，结论得证。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"base changes","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭","context":"普遍闭性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"证明中的态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"下降检验的基变换；待决。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底","context":"局部性所在基底；待决。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"Zariski 局部性；待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章名；待决。"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"基底概形；待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"基底态射及箭头性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"基底态射及箭头性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"证明中的图；待决。"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔","context":"图中方块性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭","context":"态射及子集的闭性；待决。"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平","context":"图中箭头方向；待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"水平箭头性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"base changes","target_term":"基变换","context":"水平箭头来源；待决。"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集","context":"闭集检验；待决。"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆","context":"逆像修饰语；待决。"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像","context":"逆像；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
