{"unit_id":"tag:0CEW:proof","translation":"证明与引理<REF_0001>的证明相同，利用了拟紧（quasi-compact）平坦（flat）满射（surjective）态射（morphism）是普遍商映射（universally submersive）这一事实，见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"universally submersive","target_term":"普遍商映射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"下降检验中的态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"universally submersive","target_term":"普遍商映射","context":"任意基变换后为商映射；待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章名；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02KU:statement","translation":"性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>是分离（separated）的”在基底（base）上是 fpqc 局部（local）的。\n","allowed_english":["fpqc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底","context":"局部性所在基底；待决。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"fpqc 局部性；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02KU:proof","translation":"分离（separated）态射（morphism）的基变换（base change）是分离（separated）的，见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0001>。分离（separated）这一性质在基底（base）上是 Zariski 局部（local）的（由定义可得，或见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0002>）。最后，设<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affine schemes）之间的平坦（flat）满射（surjective）态射（morphism），并设<MATH_0002>是一个态射（morphism）。假设基变换（base change）<MATH_0003>是分离（separated）的。这意味着<MATH_0004>是闭浸入（closed immersion），因而是普遍闭（universally closed）的。注意，<MATH_0005>是<MATH_0006>沿<MATH_0007>的基变换（base change）。由引理<REF_0003>，这意味着<MATH_0008>是普遍闭（universally closed）的。由于它是浸入（immersion）（《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0004>），可得<MATH_0009>是闭浸入（closed immersion）。所以<MATH_0010>是分离（separated）的。因此引理<REF_0005>适用，结论得证。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"分离性的下降；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"证明中的态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"态射及对角态射的基变换；待决。"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"引用章名；待决。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底","context":"局部性所在基底；待决。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"Zariski 局部性；待决。"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"基底概形；待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"基底态射假设；待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"基底态射假设；待决。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"对角态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭","context":"对角态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入","context":"对角态射性质；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
